OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr holds back tears on
OL,4,Aspecial night at National Television
OL,5,AAwards
OL,6,
OL,7,FYou can see a full list of winners at
OL,8,Fthe bottom of this article
OL,10,FAlan Carr had an emotional night at the
OL,11,F31st National Television Awards on
OL,12,FTuesday as he received the Special
OL,13,FRecognition prize following a whirlwind
OL,14,Fyear for the comedian.
OL,16,FThe London audience had just been
OL,17,Ftreated to a Traitors-themed musical
OL,18,Fperformance in his honour, which
OL,19,Fincluded fellow cast member Paloma
OL,20,FFaith emerging from a coffin, when he
OL,21,Fwas given the surprise award.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
