OL,3,GNEWSAAlan Carr holds back tears on
OL,4,Aspecial night at National Television
OL,5,AAwards
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to BBC News on the red carpet
OL,8,Fbefore the ceremony, Carr had played
OL,9,Fdown his chances of winning for his
OL,10,Fsemi-autobiographical comedy Changing
OL,11,FEnds.
